      {
        "@id": "https://pid.geoscience.gov.au/def/voc/ga/SeabedGeomorphologySettings/Current-induced_Process"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
      {
        "@value": "Tend to be larger than BEDFORMS (e.g. Venditti, 2013), are often forced by macro-scale topography (e.g. CHANNELS - POINTBAR; HEADLANDS - BANNER), and develop over longer periods of time (e.g. Dury, 1970).",
        "@language": "en"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme": [
